1
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:34,788
I really should get to those samurai
before someone else steals all the glory.

2
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:37,600
It's time to get serious.

3
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,118
A little hands-on time, and
he'll melt in an instant.

4
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:47,720
Ready to broadcast his message all over
the island, Cayman lady? Yes, ma 'am.

5
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,317
All right, Blackleg.

6
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:52,840
I'm very busy so time for
you to call Nico Robin

7
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:57,852
You don't want to keep my girls
waiting all night, do you?

8
00:01:58,380 --> 00:02:02,877
We've set up a very elaborate
trap you see my webs hard gum.

9
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:05,607
I call them are lining
the entrance in layers

10
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,937
They're lining the floor too.

11
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:11,180
So one step inside and you're stuck

12
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:16,340
My subordinates are waiting with
tranquilizer guns to fire on my prey

13
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:20,140
The rest is up to you.

14
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:29,920
So call Nico Robin or I'll make you pay!

15
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:36,220
Come on!

16
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:38,160
I'm in a hurry here!

17
00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:41,140
I need to go finish off those samurai!

18
00:02:44,260 --> 00:02:45,090
Robin.

19
00:02:47,760 --> 00:02:50,500
What I want is to join you.

20
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,150
What?!

21
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,860
I want to live!

22
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:05,920
Stubborn, aren't you?

23
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:11,740
Come on! Come on!

24
00:03:11,860 --> 00:03:13,020
How sad!

25
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,457
I can hardly watch!

26
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:16,180
What a bloody man!

27
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:18,676
He'd do anything to save his courage!

28
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:21,660
Now he'll die without saying a word!

29
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,560
He's still in my heart!

30
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,760
But alas, he's our fault!

31
00:03:26,340 --> 00:03:27,460
Wait... No!

32
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,620
You want me to talk?

33
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:41,260
Alright then, I've got a few words!

34
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:45,520
He's going to say something like

35
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:54,280
Blackleg, don't do it You really
make you suffer Robin, I'm sorry

36
00:03:54,920 --> 00:04:01,480
It looks like this is it for me I wish I
could have seen you smile one last time

37
00:04:07,820 --> 00:04:09,217
Help me, Robin!

38
00:04:09,300 --> 00:04:11,240
Help me, please!

39
00:04:18,060 --> 00:04:20,320
Calls her for help after all that!

40
00:04:23,580 --> 00:04:27,000
I'm on the third floor
in the banquet hall!

41
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,600
I've been taken hostage!

42
00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:32,380
I'm sorry! Sanji.

43
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:36,460
They said if you don't come
here soon, they'll kill me!

44
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:38,637
I'll leave this in your hands!

45
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,980
Yes, please, come rescue me!

46
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,630
Pathetic.

47
00:04:42,713 --> 00:04:44,600
Put the bastard out of his misery.

48
00:04:44,860 --> 00:04:46,637
One of the Straw Hats is in trouble!

49
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,260
Oh no! A broadcast?

50
00:04:48,780 --> 00:04:51,368
They must want all of
Onigashima to hear it.

51
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:59,088
Nico Robin is one of the most
important figures in the world.

52
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:02,455
Of course, it figures that
they're after her knowledge.

53
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:08,038
Sounds like they're trying
to lead Robin into a trap.

54
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:12,492
It's one thing for a man to
cry if that's downright whiny.

55
00:05:20,140 --> 00:05:22,199
Those Straw Hats are one of a kind.

56
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:25,237
I bet a woman got him
and he won't fight back.

57
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,240
Go figure.

58
00:05:27,020 --> 00:05:28,940
Hey, Nami! Sanji's voice!

59
00:05:29,140 --> 00:05:30,669
It's coming from that cat!

60
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,780
Be careful!

61
00:05:32,140 --> 00:05:33,240
I saw one earlier.

62
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:36,097
They all had that weird eye on their face.

63
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,520
I'm begging you!

64
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:39,470
ROBIN!

65
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,740
I can't believe it.

66
00:05:54,260 --> 00:05:56,160
Alright, I called for Robin.

67
00:05:56,640 --> 00:05:58,500
Keep your word. Untie me.

68
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:03,942
Someone's here.

69
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:05,817
And it sounds like we're under attack.

70
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:10,840
Well, that was fast you're so
naive you think I'd let you go

71
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:14,280
If I recall you said you loved me, right?

72
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:17,480
That means this matter
isn't business anymore.

73
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:19,060
It's personal

74
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:23,915
You can be my precious pet you'll fit
in with the rest of them perfectly

75
00:06:29,900 --> 00:06:33,280
I'll make your body
unable to live without me

76
00:06:35,900 --> 00:06:39,020
Lady Black Maria, impossible.

77
00:06:39,620 --> 00:06:41,855
Because I want to love all the ladies!

78
00:06:42,100 --> 00:06:46,960
Being unfaithful already, then
you'll have to be punished! Hold on!

79
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:49,400
I don't want to hurt a lady's fist!

80
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:51,520
I'll drop my armament, Haki!

81
00:06:52,980 --> 00:06:54,540
Mille Fleur, go!

82
00:06:57,380 --> 00:06:59,060
Giga Zata Mano!

83
00:07:00,400 --> 00:07:01,230
And Spike!

84
00:07:07,300 --> 00:07:08,280
My lady!

85
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,560
How did you manage to get in here?

86
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:26,260
My flowers can bloom anywhere.

87
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:30,240
You dare to slap my face!

88
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,497
That wasn't much of a plan.

89
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:36,777
You thought I'd walk straight into
your trap just because Sanji called me?

90
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:38,820
I'm so glad you're here!

91
00:07:46,520 --> 00:07:49,880
I was part of an evil
organization for quite a while.

92
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:53,800
So I can't help but show
my devilish side sometimes.

93
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:58,711
Especially if someone is foolish
enough to harm my friends.

94
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,160
I beg your pardon.

95
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:09,617
Just passing through with the
cold gales of the underworld.

96
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:12,320
Ruck! Ah!

97
00:08:16,220 --> 00:08:17,100
Bad news!

98
00:08:17,360 --> 00:08:19,757
Our entire ambush unit has been taken out!

99
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:21,437
The traps were destroyed, too!

100
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,637
He froze the threads and shattered them.

101
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:27,937
I'm a bit surprised it
turned out quite so well.

102
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:30,373
The wicked winds of hell know no bounds.

103
00:08:30,620 --> 00:08:31,450
Yuh-ho?

104
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:36,640
You're scary!

105
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:39,800
Oh, you're one to talk!

106
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:41,740
Thanks, Rook.

107
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:44,277
I think you might have saved my life.

108
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,840
Anytime and anyplace.

109
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:47,580
I hate to say it.

110
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:51,308
I'd be better off helping Kin'emon
and the others on the roof.

111
00:08:52,980 --> 00:08:56,320
For some reason, I feel like
I just can't win this one.

112
00:08:56,740 --> 00:08:57,857
You're right about that.

113
00:08:57,940 --> 00:08:59,280
Come back, Blackleg!

114
00:08:59,540 --> 00:09:01,260
You were meant to be my pet!

115
00:09:01,540 --> 00:09:03,080
I won't let you go!

116
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:04,920
Any last words?

117
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,960
Or is that it?

118
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:20,897
Why are you protecting that
idiot when he sold you out?

119
00:09:20,980 --> 00:09:22,757
You really think he's worth your life?

120
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,140
How sad.

121
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:25,657
You don't have friends.

122
00:09:25,740 --> 00:09:28,560
If you did, you would surely understand.

123
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:34,500
It's a fine thing, trusting someone.

124
00:09:36,660 --> 00:09:37,490
Sanji!

125
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:42,440
Thanks for counting on me. I mean it.

126
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:43,900
That made me happy.

127
00:09:46,580 --> 00:09:47,740
Oh, wait!

128
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:49,760
Watch the eyes!

129
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:51,290
Yeah.

130
00:09:56,100 --> 00:09:57,400
Good luck, you two!

131
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,180
Mice don't normally do that.

132
00:10:07,820 --> 00:10:09,996
It's from Father's surveillance team.

133
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,257
They're known as the Marys.

134
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:13,600
It's a cyborg, thus the smoke.

135
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:15,340
They're modified animals.

136
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:17,897
They've been fitted with
mechanical body parts.

137
00:10:17,980 --> 00:10:18,810
So strange!

138
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:22,977
These creatures wander around the
island without a particular objective

139
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:26,880
but they can share what they see
and the human marries take note

140
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:29,540
but where else could we go

141
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:39,337
sure this is where they're
at hard to say since no

142
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:42,257
one's been to this cursed
place in ages doesn't look like

143
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:45,897
anyone's opened the door
broken in even hey we got

144
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:49,240
nothing else to go on Let's
bust in there and find out.

145
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:52,557
Kill the kid and young master
Yamato can be the next Shogun.

146
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:54,377
It sounds like they sent a whole team.

147
00:10:54,460 --> 00:10:56,937
And if we stay here long,
they're only going to send more.

148
00:10:57,020 --> 00:10:58,100
Let's run, Yamato.

149
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:03,007
Can you help us find a path that will
keep Lord Momonosuke out of their sights?

150
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:05,480
We know you're in there!

151
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:06,680
Come on out!

152
00:11:07,020 --> 00:11:08,960
So make us break down the door!

153
00:11:09,660 --> 00:11:10,800
One, two!

154
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:15,240
We have to move, now!

155
00:11:15,540 --> 00:11:16,860
I'm sorry, Momonosuke.

156
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:19,440
I need you to hide in my clothes.

157
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:21,430
What?

158
00:11:34,100 --> 00:11:35,600
Time to go, Shinobu!

159
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:39,018
I thought the idea was to
stay hidden from the enemy.

160
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:41,480
Not to worry.

161
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:44,759
We'll keep Momonosuke hidden
till we knock them out.

162
00:11:47,740 --> 00:11:49,860
That is not what I meant at all.

163
00:11:50,380 --> 00:11:51,210
Die!

164
00:11:55,460 --> 00:11:57,800
Uh, no need to worry, Master Jack.

165
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,057
We're blocking this passage for you.

166
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:02,022
You really should get some rest.

167
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,040
Shut up!

168
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:04,880
Out of my way!

169
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:06,850
Hey, the one!

170
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:10,393
Are the Akazaya Samurai still
in the treasure repository?

171
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:19,460
They sure are!

172
00:12:20,140 --> 00:12:22,660
Black Maria, where are you?

173
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:25,340
I'm still in the banquet hall.

174
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:30,800
Alright, stay there and I'll
finish off the Samurai myself!

175
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:39,500
Even if they're badly
injured, they're strong,

176
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:42,760
too strong to fall to one
of the Toby rope bone.

177
00:12:43,960 --> 00:12:46,780
This is my battle. Understand?

178
00:12:47,420 --> 00:12:50,220
Really underestimating
me, aren't you, Jack?

179
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:58,297
But that's fine.

180
00:12:58,380 --> 00:13:00,440
It works out this time.

181
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:11,440
The prey here is far more interesting.

182
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,920
What is that thing? A weapon?

183
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:23,180
It won't be long now, Nico Robin.

184
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:25,840
Soon you'll belong to Kaido.

185
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:29,320
I'll make sure of that.

186
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:31,760
Not likely.

187
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:33,747
You'd have to kill me first.

188
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:36,920
She's so cool!

189
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:03,297
A splendid effort.

190
00:14:03,380 --> 00:14:05,640
Warriors of the Full Moon.

191
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:17,200
A pity your power is lickety
limited by the whims of the weather.

192
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:24,590
Hydro.

193
00:14:29,940 --> 00:14:32,980
Listen, you, Gaara, must
keep moving forward!

194
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,460
I can't die.

195
00:14:35,740 --> 00:14:38,080
I won't stop till I avenge Pedro.

196
00:14:41,700 --> 00:14:43,520
What are you avenging, girl?

197
00:14:43,880 --> 00:14:44,860
This is war.

198
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,880
Pedro was prepared to die.

199
00:14:48,040 --> 00:14:51,560
Why did you come to Big Mom's
territory in the first place?

200
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:54,799
Because it sure as hell
wasn't for a lickety picnic.

201
00:14:55,540 --> 00:14:58,497
If you want to live that
bad, you should stay home.

202
00:14:58,580 --> 00:15:00,660
Go frolicking in the damned forest.

203
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:10,200
Your days of playing
pirate are over, Bunny.

204
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:14,420
All right.

205
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:19,193
I'm not fond of this lickety alliance
with the beast pirates, but oh well.

206
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:22,517
If that's what Mama
decided, I have no choice.

207
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:28,660
Besides, it's a good chance to teach those
worst-generation punks a lickety-lesson.

208
00:15:35,340 --> 00:15:37,380
And they're running!

209
00:15:37,880 --> 00:15:40,600
The enemy leader,
Momonosuke, is getting away!

210
00:15:40,940 --> 00:15:45,200
If nobody stops him,
there's gonna be trouble!

211
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:59,840
He must be hiding Momonosuke somehow!

212
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:02,660
I haven't been able to spot him yet,

213
00:16:02,820 --> 00:16:07,040
but Momonosuke is there with young
Master Yamato and the Kunoichi.

214
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,580
I know it!

215
00:16:19,380 --> 00:16:23,321
It's cramped and difficult to
breathe in here, But never mind that.

216
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:27,949
For some reason, even though my life is
in danger, I feel like I'm in heaven.

217
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:37,620
Quick, Shinobu, this way!

218
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,100
Earth is they keep coming!

219
00:16:44,540 --> 00:16:46,557
Can you take us somewhere else, please?

220
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:47,897
We need to get out of sight!

221
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:49,180
It's under control.

222
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:52,037
They can't see us once
they're unconscious, you know?

223
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:56,944
If we could find a place to hide, then
they would never see us in the first place!

224
00:16:59,860 --> 00:17:02,280
Did you get that, everybody? Huh?

225
00:17:03,400 --> 00:17:06,920
Momonosuke has a speech from
the European Storehouse!

226
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,925
He's with young Master
Yamato in the Konorichi!

227
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,460
Without a doubt!

228
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,660
Another broadcast, huh?

229
00:17:14,940 --> 00:17:17,352
Now they're going after Momo and Shinobu.

230
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:19,600
But who is Yamato?

231
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:21,480
Well, whatever.

232
00:17:22,320 --> 00:17:24,980
Hey, where's the forbidden storehouse?

233
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:26,940
I'll never tell you!

234
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:28,830
Yeah?

235
00:17:30,580 --> 00:17:32,420
The front of the skull dome!

236
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,739
It's right near the front entrance!

237
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:40,317
Kinemon's group should be at
the back of the castle tower.

238
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,440
What a pain.

239
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:43,212
That's the opposite way.

240
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:48,096
Kin'emon and the others are
injured from fighting Kaido

241
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:50,940
Momo and Shinobu are
being chased by gifters

242
00:17:51,660 --> 00:17:53,560
I don't know who needs me more

243
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:56,800
How do I decide?

244
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:03,040
No time to think about it

245
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:07,380
Let's see, whoever needs me
the most has gotta be this way

246
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,420
I can't.

247
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:33,380
This blue flame draws out my
strength, but it's all spent.

248
00:18:35,980 --> 00:18:37,660
There's nothing left.

249
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:42,860
Keep fighting!

250
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:45,316
Dig deeper than you ever have before!

251
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:50,441
If you don't, the next time you turn into
an ice soda, you'll run wild till you die!

252
00:18:52,660 --> 00:18:55,300
This is no time to despair, young man.

253
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,720
Stand up and show some courage!

254
00:18:58,960 --> 00:18:59,790
Mr.

255
00:18:59,873 --> 00:19:04,560
Raccoon is enduring the same pain as you,
but he's still working on those antidotes.

256
00:19:04,740 --> 00:19:06,622
We can't give up before he does.

257
00:19:09,260 --> 00:19:10,090
Boss?

258
00:19:10,173 --> 00:19:11,080
What happened to you?

259
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:18,620
I've still got some fight
left, even if I'm old.

260
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:25,100
A true samurai fights
to the end. Stand back.

261
00:19:25,380 --> 00:19:27,027
I'll show you how it's done.

262
00:19:31,460 --> 00:19:32,920
Help, Apu. Please.

263
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:34,651
We can't win without you.

264
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:36,057
The antibody's right there,

265
00:19:36,140 --> 00:19:39,417
but we can't break through their
defense no matter what we try.

266
00:19:39,500 --> 00:19:42,180
