269
00:19:46,400 --> 00:19:47,753
He doesn't give a damn.

270
00:19:48,060 --> 00:19:53,001
We're so close, all we gotta do is kill one
measly raccoon and the antibody is ours!

271
00:19:53,760 --> 00:19:54,860
Damn it, Drake!

272
00:19:55,280 --> 00:19:58,100
This is all your fault,
you stinkin' traitor!

273
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:01,612
Stop pretending you're some kind of hero!

274
00:20:02,320 --> 00:20:05,557
Drake isn't the only problem
we're dealing with right now.

275
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:08,169
The withered old man
got his strength back!

276
00:20:08,340 --> 00:20:10,693
Don't ask me how he pulled that one off.

277
00:20:11,900 --> 00:20:15,540
Everyone in Wano either
respected or feared this man.

278
00:20:16,260 --> 00:20:17,540
Yoguro the flower.

279
00:20:20,360 --> 00:20:23,360
That's an iron-tight defense
if I've ever seen one.

280
00:20:23,600 --> 00:20:28,071
