his door trying to recruit him.

285
00:20:41,080 --> 00:20:42,668
Yeah, I can't stop shaking.

286
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:44,360
Are you alright, boss?

287
00:20:44,600 --> 00:20:46,012
It's still you in there?

288
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:51,509
Yes, I can feel the
chill, but that's fine.

289
00:20:51,760 --> 00:20:54,960
My mind is sharp, and my body is ready.

290
00:20:57,220 --> 00:21:00,400
The virus got me, but not how I expected.

291
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:05,600
It's drawn out all my strings
down to the last inch of my life.

292
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:10,540
If that's what it's come to, fine!

293
00:21:11,820 --> 00:21:15,460
I can put this final burst
of power to good use.

294
00:21:20,540 --> 00:21:23,540
In exchange for this life that I give,

295
00:21:23,860 --> 00:21:26,600
I'll cut down all of
their strongest fighters.

296
00:21:29,220 --> 00:21:31,400
Now come at me if you dare!

297
00:21:34,280 --> 00:21:37,220
Friends, listen closely. Yes!

298
00:21:37,540 --> 00:21:38,599
We're ready, boss!

299
00:21:42,520 --> 00:21:46,120
Win or lose, I don't think
I have much time left.

300
00:21:48,780 --> 00:21:50,200
There's a chance Mr.

301
00:21:50,340 --> 00:21:52,857
Raccoon's cure won't
make it to me in time.

302
00:21:52,940 --> 00:21:55,587
In other words, I might
turn into a nice Oni.

303
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:57,900
We can't have that.

304
00:21:59,900 --> 00:22:03,540
If it happens, cut me
down without hesitation.

305
00:22:05,540 --> 00:22:10,977
that's the only way otherwise
i'll go after you all attacking

306
00:22:11,060 --> 00:22:17,237
like a wild animal and i won't
stop until you're dead at my feet i

307
00:22:17,320 --> 00:22:21,777
could never we must and we must
do it the instant he begins to

308
00:22:21,860 --> 00:22:28,120
lose himself to the plague if he
becomes an oni he'll be unstoppable

309
00:22:33,280 --> 00:22:35,040
I'm counting on you

310
00:22:36,440 --> 00:22:37,520
Don't worry,

311
00:22:37,820 --> 00:22:40,497
we'll handle them We have a reputation for

312
00:22:40,580 --> 00:22:43,500
uphold We were the Mimawari Gumi after all

313
00:22:44,840 --> 00:22:48,737
As for your tales of glory We'll consign

314
00:22:48,820 --> 00:22:52,340
them to the pages of
history Move it or die

315
00:22:53,560 --> 00:22:55,160
Here we come

316
00:23:14,100 --> 00:23:16,400
One sword style of the flower.

317
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:32,620
Special Technique!

318
00:23:39,500 --> 00:23:44,500
Flaming Hair of Holy Rage!

319
00:23:46,040 --> 00:23:47,440
Goal!

320
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:08,660
Everyone attack at once! Let's go!

321
00:24:18,420 --> 00:24:19,800
It's funny, Odin.

322
00:24:23,320 --> 00:24:25,560
I always think of what could have been

323
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:32,517
I can't help but wonder
if we might have beaten

324
00:24:32,600 --> 00:24:35,541
Kaido If we'd challenged
him back when I was young

325
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:54,520
but there's no need for regrets Kin'emon
and the others have executed a perfect raid

326
00:24:57,560 --> 00:25:03,380
and i met a fascinating man one
who became my disciple in a sense

327
00:25:11,260 --> 00:25:12,280
Listen, Mr.

328
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:15,720
Straw Hat, you have much
more potential to unlock.

329
00:25:16,080 --> 00:25:18,860
I'm certain that you'll see it in time.

330
00:25:19,560 --> 00:25:25,840
Remember, in the midst of danger
is when true power blossoms.

331
00:25:32,840 --> 00:25:35,560
If we team up, we can win this!

332
00:25:39,060 --> 00:25:40,420
Of course we can!

333
00:25:40,740 --> 00:25:44,037
I can punch through anything
now that you've taught me Ryu!

334
00:25:44,120 --> 00:25:47,000
This time I'll kick Kaido's sorry ass!

335
00:25:49,660 --> 00:25:54,337
Those were words of unshakable
conviction, and I still believe them.

336
00:25:54,420 --> 00:25:58,700
He'll achieve mastery of
Reol and become stronger.

337
