358
00:27:51,560 --> 00:27:54,380
You bastard you've had enough fun.

359
00:27:54,660 --> 00:27:56,560
I'm putting you down.

360
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:59,940
I'll use your feathers to pick my teeth

361
