I can keep holding them off.

364
00:28:32,520 --> 00:28:34,240
You're gonna pay!

365
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:49,040
You better hurry, Raccoon.

366
00:28:53,240 --> 00:28:55,120
What lickety-damn.

367
00:28:55,540 --> 00:28:58,040
