372
00:29:23,940 --> 00:29:25,120
Do it.

373
00:29:25,380 --> 00:29:26,460
I'm not afraid.

374
00:29:35,340 --> 00:29:40,777
this is a blessing a parting
gift you might say i thought that

375
00:29:40,860 --> 00:29:45,680
all i had left to do was wait
for death and yet i came this far

376
00:29:51,420 --> 00:29:53,420
Well, this is enough.

377
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:56,896
I won't put your lives at
risk because I was careless.

378
00:29:57,280 --> 00:30:02,860
I'm sorry to give you such a grisly
task, but please do this for me.

379
00:30:11,820 --> 00:30:14,880
I leave Juana's future in your hands.

380
00:30:16,280 --> 00:30:19,460
So ends Yoguro the flower.

381
00:30:22,500 --> 00:30:24,760
I have no regrets.

382
00:30:25,800 --> 00:30:27,500
I am at peace.
